My good lord,

Further to the New Year's revels: the arrangements are in hand and I will rep=
ort again within the week.

I trust this note finds you all in one piece.

Written in great expedition,
Lady Jane Rochford

--
Sent from my writing-desk. Pray excuse any brevity or blots.

